        },
        {
          "title": "PREFACE",
          "locator": "index_split_003.html",
          "member": "index_split_003.html",
          "memberPresent": true
        },
        {
          "title": "PART I.",
          "locator": "index_split_005.html",
          "member": "index_split_005.html",
          "memberPresent": true
        },
        {
          "title": "Inquiry into the Nature of Saving Faith",
          "locator": "index_split_005.html#id_Toc58053196",
          "member": "index_split_005.html",
          "memberPresent": true
        },
        {
          "title": "PART II.",
          "locator": "index_split_007.html",
          "member": "index_split_007.html",
          "memberPresent": true
        },
        {
          "title": "Arguments to prove faith in Christ is the duty of all men who hear, or have an opportunity to hear the gospel.",
          "locator": "index_split_007.html#id_Toc58053198",
          "member": "index_split_007.html",
          "memberPresent": true
        },
        {
          "title": "I. Unconverted sinners are commanded, exhorted, and invited to believe in Christ for salvation.",
          "locator": "index_split_007.html#id_Toc58053199",
          "member": "index_split_007.html",
          "memberPresent": true
        },
        {
          "title": "II. Every man is bound to cordially receive and approve whatever God reveals.",
          "locator": "index_split_007.html#id_Toc58053200",
          "member": "index_split_007.html",
          "memberPresent": true
        },
        {
          "title": "III. Though the gospel, strictly speaking, is not a law, but a message of pure grace; yet it virtually requires obedience, and such an obedience as includes saving faith.",
          "locator": "index_split_007.html#id_Toc58053201",
          "member": "index_split_007.html",
          "memberPresent": true
        },
        {
          "title": "IV. The lack of faith in Christ is ascribed in the Scriptures to men’s depravity, and is itself represented as a heinous sin.",
          "locator": "index_split_007.html#id_Toc58053202",
          "member": "index_split_007.html",
          "memberPresent": true
        },
        {
          "title": "V. God has threatened and inflicted the most awful punishments on sinners, for their not believing in the Lord Jesus Christ.",
          "locator": "index_split_007.html#id_Toc58053203",
          "member": "index_split_007.html",
          "memberPresent": true
        },
        {
          "title": "VI. Other spiritual exercises which sustain an inseparable connection with faith in Christ, are represented as the duty of men in general.",
          "locator": "index_split_007.html#id_Toc58053204",
          "member": "index_split_007.html",
          "memberPresent": true
        },
        {
          "title": "PART III. CONTAINING ANSWERS TO OBJECTIONS.",
          "locator": "index_split_008.html",
          "member": "index_split_008.html",
          "memberPresent": true
        },
        {
          "title": "On the principle of holiness possessed by man in Innocence.",
          "locator": "index_split_008.html#id_Toc58053206",
          "member": "index_split_008.html",
          "memberPresent": true
        },
        {
          "title": "Concerning the Decrees of God.",
          "locator": "index_split_008.html#id_Toc58053207",
          "member": "index_split_008.html",
          "memberPresent": true
        },
        {
          "title": "On Particular Redemption.",
          "locator": "index_split_008.html#id_Toc58053208",
          "member": "index_split_008.html",
          "memberPresent": true
        },
        {
          "title": "On sinners being under the Covenant of Works.",
          "locator": "index_split_008.html#id_Toc58053209",
          "member": "index_split_008.html",
          "memberPresent": true
        },
        {
          "title": "On the inability of sinners to believe in Christ and do things spiritually good.",
          "locator": "index_split_008.html#id_Toc58053210",
          "member": "index_split_008.html",
          "memberPresent": true
        },
        {
          "title": "Of the Work of the Holy Spirit.",
          "locator": "index_split_008.html#id_Toc58053211",
          "member": "index_split_008.html",
          "memberPresent": true
        },
        {
